WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.125
<b>Here and in the following verses,</b>

2
00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:37.416
<b>Lord Krishna explains how</b>
<b>a person of steady wisdom</b>

3
00:00:37.416 --> 00:00:41.541
<b>maintains control over their senses.</b>

4
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.541
<b>Krishna says that,</b>

5
00:00:43.541 --> 00:00:50.750
<b>Just as a turtle withdraws its limbs into</b>
<b>its hard shell from all directions,</b>

6
00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:53.083
<b>Similarly, a person of steady wisdom</b>

7
00:00:53.083 --> 00:00:59.916
<b>withdraws their senses inward, </b>
<b>protecting them from external influences.</b>

8
00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:09.750
<b>Ordinarily, a turtle keeps its </b>
<b>limbs outside its shell</b>

9
00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.125
<b>so it can move and eat</b>

10
00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:16.791
<b>it uses these limbs according to necessity.</b>

11
00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:19.083
<b>However, at the slightest hint of danger,</b>

12
00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:24.375
<b>it can pull these limbs into its hard shell.</b>

13
00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:27.083
<b>Within this shell, these limbs are safe,</b>

14
00:01:27.083 --> 00:01:30.875
<b>protected from any external threat.</b>

15
00:01:30.875 --> 00:01:31.958
<b>Similarly,</b>

16
00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:36.750
<b>for a person of steady wisdom, </b>
<b>their intellect is their shell.</b>

17
00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:43.291
<b>And just as a turtle uses its </b>
<b>limbs only when necessary,</b>

18
00:01:43.291 --> 00:01:50.583
<b>such a person uses their</b>
<b>senses only when needed.</b>

19
00:01:50.583 --> 00:01:57.625
<b>They are fully capable of willingly covering </b>
<b>their senses with the shell of their wisdom.</b>

20
00:01:57.625 --> 00:01:59.000
<b>When doing so,</b>

21
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:03.916
<b>no external contact can </b>
<b>break their concentration.</b>

22
00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:06.666
<b>By using the turtle's example here,</b>

23
00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:10.375
<b>there's also a message about </b>
<b>determination and control.</b>

24
00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:14.458
<b>Just as the turtle's shell is</b>
<b>hard and impenetrable,</b>

25
00:02:14.458 --> 00:02:15.541
<b>likewise,</b>

26
00:02:15.541 --> 00:02:20.000
<b>the intellect of a person of </b>
<b>steady wisdom is impenetrable.</b>

27
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.000
<b>No unnecessary sensation can pierce through it.</b>

28
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.875
<b>Through continuous development </b>
<b>of their intellect,</b>

29
00:02:25.875 --> 00:02:31.041
<b>such a person has gained complete</b>
<b>mastery over their senses.</b>

30
00:02:31.041 --> 00:02:37.708
<b>They can block out any sensory </b>
<b>experience that hinders their spiritual progress</b>

31
00:02:37.708 --> 00:02:43.083
<b>and utilize those that aid it.</b>

32
00:02:43.083 --> 00:02:48.125
<b>Through their wisdom, they understand</b>
<b>that in their spiritual journey, the senses</b>

33
00:02:48.125 --> 00:02:49.791
<b>are not meant for pleasure,</b>

34
00:02:49.791 --> 00:02:52.291
<b>but only for practical use.</b>

35
00:02:52.291 --> 00:02:56.000
<b>This awareness is their ally.</b>

36
00:03:00.833 --> 00:03:02.458
<b>Often,</b>

37
00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:08.291
<b>you try to make changes in</b>
<b>your life with determination,</b>

38
00:03:08.291 --> 00:03:09.041
<b>but</b>

39
00:03:09.041 --> 00:03:12.583
<b>this resolve quickly breaks,</b>

40
00:03:12.583 --> 00:03:17.791
<b>and you fall back into old habits.</b>

41
00:03:17.791 --> 00:03:21.125
<b>What should be done in such situations?</b>

42
00:03:21.125 --> 00:03:27.875
<b>Use both defense of the senses </b>
<b>and remembrance of purpose.</b>

43
00:03:27.875 --> 00:03:32.000
<b>Understand this through an example.</b>

44
00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:35.500
<b>You've decided to become healthy,</b>

45
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:41.041
<b>so excessive sweets aren't good,</b>

46
00:03:41.041 --> 00:03:42.875
<b>but</b>

47
00:03:42.875 --> 00:03:48.416
<b>there's a sweet shop on your way home.</b>

48
00:03:48.416 --> 00:03:56.375
<b>Your craving pulls you there, </b>
<b>and your resolution breaks.</b>

49
00:03:56.375 --> 00:03:57.333
<b>First,</b>

50
00:03:57.333 --> 00:03:59.291
<b>defend your senses</b>

51
00:03:59.291 --> 00:04:03.833
<b>avoid what tempts you.</b>

52
00:04:03.833 --> 00:04:05.083
<b>In this example,</b>

53
00:04:05.083 --> 00:04:09.541
<b>if you take a different route home,</b>

54
00:04:09.541 --> 00:04:16.958
<b>while the sweet shop won't completely </b>
<b>eliminate your craving by not being seen daily,</b>

55
00:04:16.958 --> 00:04:21.375
<b>it will certainly reduce.</b>

56
00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:24.500
<b>Defense is a crucial step.</b>

57
00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:32.250
<b>Try to stay away from anything </b>
<b>that hinders your purpose.</b>

58
00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:35.291
<b>Constant remembrance of purpose</b>

59
00:04:35.291 --> 00:04:42.541
<b>daily remind yourself how </b>
<b>your goal will transform your life.</b>

60
00:04:42.541 --> 00:04:51.416
<b>If possible, write this purpose </b>
<b>somewhere you can see it constantly.</b>

61
00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:53.791
<b>Continuous remembrance of your purpose</b>

62
00:04:53.791 --> 00:05:01.291
<b>will help maintain control even when </b>
<b>complete avoidance isn't possible.</b>

63
00:05:01.291 --> 00:05:02.791
<b>Reflect on this.</b>

64
00:05:02.791 --> 00:05:05.791
<b>Defense and purpose remembrance</b>

65
00:05:05.791 --> 00:05:11.708
<b>use both for achieving your goals.</b>

66
00:05:16.583 --> 00:05:22.375
<b>This world is filled with countless temptations.</b>

67
00:05:22.375 --> 00:05:29.166
<b>Human senses constantly </b>
<b>seek pleasurable things.</b>

68
00:05:29.166 --> 00:05:30.625
<b>Eyes</b>

69
00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:33.166
<b>want to see beauty,</b>

70
00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:34.125
<b>ears</b>

71
00:05:34.125 --> 00:05:36.708
<b>want to hear something enchanting,</b>

72
00:05:36.708 --> 00:05:38.041
<b>tongue</b>

73
00:05:38.041 --> 00:05:41.000
<b>craves delicious tastes.</b>

74
00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:41.958
<b>But</b>

75
00:05:41.958 --> 00:05:47.416
<b>sometimes these desires </b>
<b>can be extremely harmful.</b>

76
00:05:47.416 --> 00:05:52.500
<b>How to protect yourself and family?</b>

77
00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:57.875
<b>Here the importance of culture becomes evident.</b>

78
00:05:57.875 --> 00:06:05.000
<b>Just as a turtle's shell protects </b>
<b>it from external harm,</b>

79
00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:13.250
<b>our culture is a shield that </b>
<b>protects us from harmful desires.</b>

80
00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:14.833
<b>For example</b>

81
00:06:14.833 --> 00:06:22.375
<b>our culture teaches that food affects </b>
<b>not just the body but also the mind.</b>

82
00:06:22.375 --> 00:06:27.250
<b>It guides us about what nutritious</b>
<b>and balanced diet to take.</b>

83
00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:28.958
<b>Culture teaches</b>

84
00:06:28.958 --> 00:06:34.458
<b>spiritual ideals and how to live a generous life.</b>

85
00:06:34.458 --> 00:06:41.625
<b>Culture even guides us about </b>
<b>appropriate attire for social settings.</b>

86
00:06:41.625 --> 00:06:46.250
<b>Culture contains infinite wisdom.</b>

87
00:06:46.250 --> 00:06:48.916
<b>Science may have progressed,</b>

88
00:06:48.916 --> 00:06:52.666
<b> all resources may be modern,</b>

89
00:06:52.666 --> 00:06:53.541
<b>but</b>

90
00:06:53.541 --> 00:06:55.916
<b>you know that</b>

91
00:06:55.916 --> 00:07:00.916
<b>human nature hasn't changed</b>
<b>for thousands of years.</b>

92
00:07:00.916 --> 00:07:02.416
<b>Their desires,</b>

93
00:07:02.416 --> 00:07:05.541
<b>their wishes.</b>

94
00:07:05.541 --> 00:07:08.041
<b>Culture is ancient,</b>

95
00:07:08.041 --> 00:07:14.125
<b>containing the study of human nature</b>
<b>over countless years.</b>

96
00:07:14.125 --> 00:07:18.666
<b>It's extremely helpful for those who use it.</b>

97
00:07:18.666 --> 00:07:24.750
<b>Don't see it merely as </b>
<b>religious customs and rituals.</b>

98
00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.500
<b>See it as cultural values,</b>

99
00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:31.541
<b>as life guidelines.</b>

100
00:07:31.541 --> 00:07:34.833
<b>Increase your own cultural inclination,</b>

101
00:07:34.833 --> 00:07:37.333
<b>inspire your family too.</b>

102
00:07:37.333 --> 00:07:42.083
<b>Use this shield for your protection.</b>

103
00:07:47.041 --> 00:07:53.958
<b>In your organization, there might</b>
<b>be hundreds of others working.</b>

104
00:07:53.958 --> 00:08:01.541
<b>In such a place, controlling your </b>
<b>emotions and reactions becomes essential.</b>

105
00:08:01.541 --> 00:08:06.916
<b>And this isn't just about maintaining</b>
<b>relationships with others.</b>

106
00:08:06.916 --> 00:08:12.625
<b>It's also necessary because </b>
<b>if you get quickly excited,</b>

107
00:08:12.625 --> 00:08:18.500
<b>this disturbed state of mind </b>
<b>will affect your personal work.</b>

108
00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:19.791
<b>But</b>

109
00:08:19.791 --> 00:08:27.666
<b>in such a large workplace, </b>
<b>situations that provoke you are natural.</b>

110
00:08:27.666 --> 00:08:30.416
<b>What should be done?</b>

111
00:08:30.416 --> 00:08:32.083
<b>There's a saying: </b>

112
00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:36.000
<b>"Prevention is better than cure."</b>

113
00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:40.416
<b>Complete remedy of such</b>
<b>situations isn't possible.</b>

114
00:08:40.416 --> 00:08:44.000
<b>You must protect yourself.</b>

115
00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:48.500
<b>If a provocative situation arises,</b>

116
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:53.250
<b>first take a deep breath,</b>

117
00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:54.958
<b>pause,</b>

118
00:08:54.958 --> 00:08:59.625
<b>and hold your reaction for that moment.</b>

119
00:08:59.625 --> 00:09:05.333
<b>If necessary, step away to your space for a while,</b>

120
00:09:05.333 --> 00:09:11.750
<b>just as a turtle retreats into its shell.</b>

121
00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.791
<b>When some time has passed,</b>

122
00:09:14.791 --> 00:09:21.833
<b>you'll be ready to resolve this </b>
<b>situation with peace and clarity.</b>

123
00:09:21.833 --> 00:09:28.666
<b>Maybe you'll decide it's best </b>
<b>to ignore the situation.</b>

124
00:09:28.666 --> 00:09:35.375
<b>Anyway, in a professional environment,</b>
<b>not all situations need resolving.</b>

125
00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:39.250
<b>Ignoring some is their right solution.</b>

